    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stoatman is an exciting adventure where you play as a brave stoat in a dangerous fairy-tale world. A small but mighty stoat wielding a powerful magical sword, you are set to discover hidden secrets and face challenges along the way. Master powerful spells, explore mysterious lands, and battle incredible creatures in this thrilling Metroidvania adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/extras/1eeec27f6753175c82713c42c4372b22.poster.avif?t=1747121334\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/extras/1eeec27f6753175c82713c42c4372b22.webm?t=1747121334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/extras/1eeec27f6753175c82713c42c4372b22.mp4?t=1747121334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious world filled with both charming and deadly creatures, hidden locations, and secret paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat - fight with sword strikes and powerful magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving magic system - from humble spells to devastating powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere - detailed 2D graphics, smooth animations, and intricate lighting effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on exploration - discover secrets, solve puzzles, and uncover new paths, all without relying on dialogue.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stoatman is an exciting adventure where you play as a brave stoat in a dangerous fairy-tale world. A small but mighty stoat wielding a powerful magical sword, you are set to discover hidden secrets and face challenges along the way. Master powerful spells, explore mysterious lands, and battle incredible creatures in this thrilling Metroidvania adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/extras/1eeec27f6753175c82713c42c4372b22.poster.avif?t=1747121334\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/extras/1eeec27f6753175c82713c42c4372b22.webm?t=1747121334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664520/extras/1eeec27f6753175c82713c42c4372b22.mp4?t=1747121334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious world filled with both charming and deadly creatures, hidden locations, and secret paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat - fight with sword strikes and powerful magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evolving magic system - from humble spells to devastating powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive atmosphere - detailed 2D graphics, smooth animations, and intricate lighting effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on exploration - discover secrets, solve puzzles, and uncover new paths, all without relying on dialogue.</p></li></ul>",
